WEBVTT

01:34.979 --> 01:37.780
[Bloom Life]

01:38.780 --> 01:43.610
[2007]

01:43.710 --> 01:45.440
I see a pilaf vendor over there.

01:45.930 --> 01:47.259
Pilaf. I love pilaf!

01:47.570 --> 01:48.450
Let's go.

01:49.289 --> 01:50.030
Dad,

01:50.180 --> 01:52.509
why are there
so many people in the bazaar?

01:52.789 --> 01:54.490
Because in our Kashgar,

01:54.770 --> 01:55.940
the bazaar is like a father,

01:55.940 --> 01:57.060
and also a mother.

01:57.690 --> 01:59.830
Anything can happen in the bazaar.

02:09.370 --> 02:09.970
Thank you.

02:10.979 --> 02:11.990
Lamb leg pilaf.

02:13.910 --> 02:14.660
Let me see.

02:20.620 --> 02:22.460
Look, what's this?

02:22.460 --> 02:23.660
A sheep knucklebone.

02:24.310 --> 02:25.310
Then break it open for me to see.

02:25.310 --> 02:26.030
Okay.

02:26.910 --> 02:27.570
Here you go.

02:29.590 --> 02:30.620
One for each of us.

02:30.620 --> 02:32.020
Right, one for each of us.

02:41.920 --> 02:45.720
[Episode 2: Those Who Left
and Those Who Stayed]

02:55.560 --> 02:58.780
One, two, three, four.

02:58.780 --> 03:01.910
Five, six, seven, eight.

03:02.630 --> 03:05.520
Two, two, three, four.

03:05.850 --> 03:09.280
Five, six, seven, eight.

03:09.900 --> 03:13.020
Three, two, three, four.

03:13.020 --> 03:16.070
Five, six, seven, eight.

03:16.940 --> 03:17.410
Stop.

03:17.410 --> 03:18.590
Alright, let's take a break.

03:18.590 --> 03:21.590
Your feet are bleeding.
Can you still wear high heels?

03:23.400 --> 03:24.470
Let me tell you,

03:24.570 --> 03:25.780
they suddenly announced today

03:25.780 --> 03:26.470
the casting for the lead actress

03:26.470 --> 03:27.470
of Alip and Sänäm.

03:27.620 --> 03:28.870
Sänäm is the role

03:28.870 --> 03:30.690
I've wanted to play since I was a child.

03:30.690 --> 03:31.850
If I wear flat shoes,

03:31.850 --> 03:33.970
how can I outshine those new girls?

03:34.290 --> 03:36.150
You‘re just looking for trouble.

03:38.390 --> 03:41.520
Why are you dressed
in the same color as the ancient city?

03:42.190 --> 03:43.650
These are Morandi colors.

03:43.650 --> 03:44.570
They are very classy.

03:44.570 --> 03:46.010
Looks like a sandstorm.

03:48.700 --> 03:49.440
How is it?

03:50.060 --> 03:51.610
Compared to those fresh graduates,

03:51.610 --> 03:53.270
I can still hold my own, right?

03:53.560 --> 03:55.340
You're the star of your troupe.

03:55.340 --> 03:57.730
Why are you comparing yourself
to a bunch of little girls?

03:57.730 --> 03:58.990
You don't understand.

03:59.060 --> 03:59.850
Alright,

03:59.850 --> 04:02.090
you couldn't be any prettier.

04:03.340 --> 04:04.190
Girls!

04:04.210 --> 04:05.410
For our troupe's revival of

04:05.410 --> 04:06.600
"Alip and Sänäm",

04:06.620 --> 04:07.840
besides showing

04:07.840 --> 04:09.740
Sänäm's brave side,

04:09.740 --> 04:11.300
we must also give it a contemporary feel.

04:11.300 --> 04:13.830
We need to focus on
portraying her as a woman

04:13.850 --> 04:15.320
with a spirit of self-pursuit.

04:15.320 --> 04:16.620
Technically speaking,

04:16.620 --> 04:17.370
we

04:17.370 --> 04:18.899
will focus on using spins

04:18.899 --> 04:21.100
to express her rebellion against fate.

04:22.120 --> 04:23.360
Good. Keep it up.

04:25.390 --> 04:26.430
Come on, girls.

04:26.460 --> 04:27.550
Look alive.

04:29.190 --> 04:30.310
Good.

04:31.770 --> 04:32.540
Keep it up.

04:44.540 --> 04:45.330
Dad.

04:47.570 --> 04:48.390
Dad.

04:52.010 --> 04:52.810
Dad.

04:53.890 --> 04:56.370
Can we not let Mulading
fill out the forms anymore?

04:56.370 --> 04:58.940
His handwriting is so crooked,
even a sheep could write better.

04:58.940 --> 04:59.659
Others can't read it,

04:59.659 --> 05:01.590
and they send it back for me to redo.

05:02.630 --> 05:05.950
Is it wrong for him
to help you fill out the forms?

05:07.620 --> 05:08.890
Without him in the house,

05:08.890 --> 05:10.300
I would've died of exhaustion long ago.

05:10.300 --> 05:12.070
Then you can teach me to make earthenware.

05:12.070 --> 05:13.180
I promise I'll do it better

05:13.180 --> 05:14.310
and faster than him.

05:14.440 --> 05:15.370
How can a woman

05:15.370 --> 05:16.430
make earthenware?

05:16.770 --> 05:18.570
Women can wash clothes and cook.

05:18.590 --> 05:20.450
Why can't they make earthenware?

05:20.540 --> 05:21.210
No way.

05:27.450 --> 05:28.860
Laili, you're back.

05:28.980 --> 05:30.450
I bought some figs.

05:30.450 --> 05:31.330
Try some.

05:34.130 --> 05:34.870
Mom!

05:36.320 --> 05:37.020
Mom,

05:37.280 --> 05:39.210
why did you let him wash my clothes?

05:40.100 --> 05:41.500
I didn't look carefully.

05:41.540 --> 05:44.120
I hid them under my pillow on purpose.

05:44.620 --> 05:46.890
I said I'd wash them myself.

05:47.300 --> 05:49.210
An apprentice is like a son.

05:49.490 --> 05:50.920
He is filial to his master.

05:50.920 --> 05:52.240
So we should treat him

05:52.300 --> 05:53.330
like family.

05:53.350 --> 05:54.500
Even so,

05:54.500 --> 05:55.420
family doesn't mean-

05:55.420 --> 05:56.350
What's the fuss?

05:56.430 --> 05:58.290
You'll marry him sooner or later.

05:58.330 --> 05:59.750
When did I say I'd marry him?

05:59.750 --> 06:00.550
Stop the fuss.

06:43.360 --> 06:45.360
Great job, Minawar.

06:47.220 --> 06:47.830
Good.

06:47.860 --> 06:49.860
You didn't embarrass the veterans.

06:50.100 --> 06:51.130
Back then, you relied on

06:51.130 --> 06:52.740
this eight-beat spinning trick

06:52.740 --> 06:53.800
to join our troupe.

06:54.280 --> 06:55.620
You still have the skills.

06:55.620 --> 06:56.350
Good job.

06:58.980 --> 07:00.360
Minawar danced so well.

07:00.380 --> 07:02.230
Yes, she's amazing.

07:02.270 --> 07:03.420
It has to be Minawar.

07:03.420 --> 07:05.540
She's so stable even in high heels.

07:06.450 --> 07:08.300
She's truly our star.

07:08.940 --> 07:10.940
I was just doing what I had to.

07:12.130 --> 07:14.280
Band-Aids and plasters are in the drawer.

07:14.280 --> 07:15.210
Take it easy.

07:40.680 --> 07:41.630
Okay.

07:41.630 --> 07:44.060
I'll pack and send the pots later.

07:49.210 --> 07:50.100
Sorry.

07:50.100 --> 07:51.830
What's going on here?

07:51.830 --> 07:53.620
He hit you. It's him.

07:55.330 --> 07:55.830
Sorry.

07:55.830 --> 07:56.870
I-I didn't mean to.

07:56.870 --> 07:58.440
I was playing football with them.

07:58.440 --> 07:59.690
Anyway, the ball didn't hit me.

07:59.690 --> 08:00.710
You hit me.

08:03.390 --> 08:04.850
What should I do?

08:04.950 --> 08:05.540
You tell me.

08:05.540 --> 08:06.690
Pay for it then.

08:06.940 --> 08:07.590
How much?

08:08.940 --> 08:09.690
600.

08:13.660 --> 08:14.330
Okay.

08:14.540 --> 08:15.370
600 it is.

08:20.660 --> 08:21.100
Sorry.

08:21.100 --> 08:22.060
I didn't bring any money

08:22.060 --> 08:22.690
or my phone today.

08:22.690 --> 08:23.000
I...

08:23.890 --> 08:26.290
You didn't bring money.
Are you kidding me?

08:27.100 --> 08:28.060
Wait a minute.

08:30.100 --> 08:32.360
I'll leave this bag with you as a deposit.

08:32.570 --> 08:33.450
What's this?

08:33.450 --> 08:35.850
These are my tools for making instruments.

08:40.179 --> 08:41.900
Then where can I find you?

08:41.900 --> 08:43.450
Adijiang Instrument Shop.

08:44.300 --> 08:45.440
Adijiang Instrument Shop.

08:45.440 --> 08:46.470
I live there.

09:04.990 --> 09:06.570
Come, sit inside.

09:06.570 --> 09:07.900
Come, please sit inside.

09:07.900 --> 09:08.490
No, thanks.

09:08.490 --> 09:10.280
Come inside.

09:20.190 --> 09:20.970
Dear guests,

09:22.450 --> 09:24.690
you've been sitting here for a while

09:24.710 --> 09:26.490
without ordering anything.

09:26.630 --> 09:28.440
Are you waiting for someone?

09:28.660 --> 09:30.190
Or is there something else?

09:30.260 --> 09:32.660
Go ask Adili about this.

09:33.030 --> 09:35.130
So you're Adili's friends.

09:37.230 --> 09:38.370
Adili?

09:38.390 --> 09:40.320
He went out driving.

09:40.380 --> 09:41.920
He hasn't come back yet.

09:41.920 --> 09:44.300
What do you want with Adili?

09:44.980 --> 09:47.910
Adili borrowed
some money from our company.

09:50.570 --> 09:52.450
Today is the day the money is due.

09:52.450 --> 09:53.160
Look.

09:58.900 --> 10:00.520
We know about the contract,

10:00.800 --> 10:02.050
but he hasn't come back.

10:02.050 --> 10:03.800
And we can't contact him either.

10:03.800 --> 10:04.520
How about you...

10:04.520 --> 10:05.980
There's no other options.

10:06.760 --> 10:08.260
The contract is very clear.

10:08.260 --> 10:10.200
Today, either you give me the money,

10:10.200 --> 10:12.290
or this shop belongs to me.

10:14.140 --> 10:16.330
Will they give us the money today?

10:18.810 --> 10:21.900
Today, either we get the money
or we get the shop.

10:30.870 --> 10:33.490
I'll mortgage these to you first.

10:33.920 --> 10:36.990
My son will definitely
pay you back when he returns.

10:38.760 --> 10:39.440
Just these?

10:57.040 --> 10:57.920
Let's go.

11:14.280 --> 11:15.210
Good afternoon.

11:15.400 --> 11:16.480
Good afternoon.

11:16.740 --> 11:18.010
You're in such a hurry to leave?

11:18.010 --> 11:18.750
Yeah.

11:18.780 --> 11:19.940
-Work won't wait for me.
-Let me.

11:19.940 --> 11:20.540
I'll do it.

11:21.680 --> 11:23.740
-Give it to me.
-Didn't you get fired?

11:24.990 --> 11:26.560
That's not certain yet.

11:26.560 --> 11:28.110
I can still try.

11:28.500 --> 11:30.010
Why do people try so hard

11:30.030 --> 11:32.070
to become a piece of a jigsaw puzzle?

11:32.610 --> 11:33.730
What do you mean?

11:34.040 --> 11:34.800
If I were you,

11:34.830 --> 11:35.800
I wouldn't go to work.

11:35.800 --> 11:36.940
I'd rather be the missing piece

11:36.940 --> 11:38.160
in the puzzle.

11:38.540 --> 11:40.130
Good for you.

11:40.150 --> 11:42.610
Only you care about
the finer things in life.

11:44.760 --> 11:46.570
My finer things are right here.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.250
I'm here to open a homestay.

11:48.330 --> 11:50.880
Okay. Just don't open it
next to our house.

11:53.310 --> 11:54.400
Arzugul,

11:54.400 --> 11:55.640
tell me,

11:55.640 --> 11:57.590
if you're not comfortable living there,

11:57.590 --> 11:58.680
I will clear out

11:58.680 --> 11:59.990
the biggest room on the second floor

11:59.990 --> 12:00.990
for you, okay?

12:01.350 --> 12:03.630
Uncle, I live very well up there.

12:03.760 --> 12:04.880
I still have things to do in the company,

12:04.880 --> 12:06.130
so I have to go back quickly.

12:06.130 --> 12:07.520
I'll go back and spend time with my mom

12:07.520 --> 12:09.050
and leave tomorrow or the day after.

12:09.050 --> 12:09.570
You-

12:09.600 --> 12:10.490
Sweetie,

12:11.520 --> 12:14.310
work can be done anytime, right?

12:14.610 --> 12:16.910
Arzugul, you came back from Shanghai

12:16.930 --> 12:19.600
and haven't even eaten my almond tart yet.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.300
Grandma,

12:22.330 --> 12:24.040
I don't want to leave either.

12:24.850 --> 12:28.140
But the company is pushing hard.

12:28.160 --> 12:29.990
You finally came back once.

12:29.990 --> 12:31.990
Why don't you
spend more time with Grandma?

12:31.990 --> 12:33.990
Can the company not run without you?

12:35.470 --> 12:37.760
Your troupe can't run without you, right?

12:37.760 --> 12:39.660
Your foot is swollen like that,

12:39.880 --> 12:42.140
but you still have to dance in high heels.

12:42.590 --> 12:43.490
Arzugul,

12:43.980 --> 12:45.730
You finally came back to Kashgar

12:45.730 --> 12:47.850
from Shanghai.

12:48.160 --> 12:51.300
Don't you buy some gifts
for your colleagues?

12:51.570 --> 12:52.560
Minawar,

12:52.560 --> 12:53.990
today is the grand bazaar.

12:53.990 --> 12:55.380
You take Arzugul

12:55.760 --> 12:56.950
there for a walk.

12:56.950 --> 12:57.670
I...

12:57.990 --> 12:59.850
have to go back to the troupe later.

12:59.850 --> 13:01.230
It's fine, I know the way.

13:01.230 --> 13:02.180
I can go by myself.

13:02.180 --> 13:03.210
Minawar,

13:03.380 --> 13:04.310
didn't you say

13:04.310 --> 13:07.260
you were going to the bazaar
to buy things this afternoon?

13:07.260 --> 13:08.490
Why haven't you left yet?

13:08.490 --> 13:09.070
No.

13:09.260 --> 13:10.950
Look at the time.

13:10.970 --> 13:12.210
They're closing soon.

13:12.210 --> 13:13.040
Go now.

13:13.210 --> 13:14.270
It's running late.

13:14.490 --> 13:15.830
I've told you since you were little

13:15.830 --> 13:17.490
that you should dress up nicely
when visiting the bazaar.

13:17.490 --> 13:18.650
Look at you now.

13:20.850 --> 13:21.400
Here.

13:26.040 --> 13:26.840
Uncle.

13:26.860 --> 13:27.990
Let me do it.

13:29.990 --> 13:30.800
Alright.

13:31.070 --> 13:31.880
Here you go.

14:42.220 --> 14:44.480
I'm on a diet. I don't drink sweet things.

14:49.090 --> 14:51.090
Are you really here to buy things?

14:51.960 --> 14:53.610
Have you been away for too long
and forgotten it?

14:53.610 --> 14:55.420
When us women visit the bazaar,

14:55.420 --> 14:56.540
it's mainly to show off

14:56.540 --> 14:58.020
our beauty and clothes.

14:58.020 --> 14:59.900
Buying things is just an excuse.

15:02.580 --> 15:03.840
Did you bring perfume?

15:10.970 --> 15:12.090
What's this smell?

15:12.110 --> 15:13.030
Woody scent.

15:13.810 --> 15:15.900
You might as well plant a tree at home
instead of wearing this.

15:15.900 --> 15:16.690
When you wear perfume,

15:16.690 --> 15:18.180
it should be floral.

15:18.180 --> 15:19.900
Like walking into a garden.

15:23.610 --> 15:26.060
I heard your house is built.

15:26.060 --> 15:27.590
Over 20,000 a square meter.

15:27.850 --> 15:28.650
So expensive.

15:29.180 --> 15:31.940
I'll take you to see
our new house someday.

15:31.940 --> 15:33.780
The best neighborhood in Kashgar.

15:33.780 --> 15:35.450
We bought 300 to 400 square meters.

15:35.450 --> 15:36.420
How big is yours?

15:36.890 --> 15:38.150
Over 60 square meters.

15:39.260 --> 15:40.450
That's so small.

15:40.450 --> 15:43.250
I really don't know
what you're after in Shanghai.

15:43.730 --> 15:45.300
We don't have

15:45.690 --> 15:47.300
to force a conversation.

15:47.540 --> 15:48.810
How about we go our separate ways?

15:48.810 --> 15:49.520
Sure.

16:01.810 --> 16:03.780
Where can I buy a Yengisar knife?

16:04.330 --> 16:06.020
Let's go, I'll show you around.

16:06.020 --> 16:07.040
Come take a look.

16:07.040 --> 16:08.810
Handmade Yengisar knives.

16:08.810 --> 16:10.540
Come take a look, beauties.

16:10.540 --> 16:11.540
Handmade knives.

16:12.060 --> 16:13.070
Let me see this one.

16:13.070 --> 16:13.940
Okay, beauty.

16:19.810 --> 16:20.660
How much is this one?

16:20.660 --> 16:21.090
800.

16:22.310 --> 16:23.420
You're Minawar's friend,

16:23.420 --> 16:24.540
I'll give you a discount.

16:24.540 --> 16:25.300
660.

16:25.810 --> 16:26.540
Alright.

16:26.540 --> 16:27.540
Since Minawar said so,

16:27.540 --> 16:28.260
it's a deal.

16:28.260 --> 16:28.940
Wait a minute.

16:28.940 --> 16:29.780
I just threw out a number.

16:29.780 --> 16:30.690
I'm not the one buying.

16:30.690 --> 16:31.180
It's fine.

16:31.180 --> 16:32.540
660 it is.

16:32.540 --> 16:33.540
For good luck.

16:33.670 --> 16:34.670
Are you crazy?

16:34.690 --> 16:36.290
Spending 600 on a knife.

16:36.600 --> 16:38.400
Does money grow on trees for you?

16:38.750 --> 16:40.040
I'm giving it to a client.

16:40.040 --> 16:41.840
Of course I have to buy a nice one.

16:43.640 --> 16:45.640
When did you become so tactful?

16:46.350 --> 16:48.610
Just doing what it takes to make a living.

16:52.300 --> 16:53.660
Come take a look.

16:53.660 --> 16:55.560
A batch of amazing
tumbler pigeons arrived today.

16:55.560 --> 16:56.850
They're so incredible that once they fly,

16:56.850 --> 16:58.440
they can do 6 or 7 somersaults in a row.

16:58.440 --> 16:59.640
Come take a look.

16:59.640 --> 17:01.520
A batch of amazing
tumbler pigeons arrived today.

17:01.520 --> 17:02.880
They're so incredible that once they fly,

17:02.880 --> 17:04.040
they can do 6 or 7 somersaults in a row.

17:04.040 --> 17:04.920
Then they dive straight down,

17:04.920 --> 17:06.760
and when they're
just 6 cm from the ground,

17:06.760 --> 17:07.750
they can suddenly fly back up.

17:07.750 --> 17:09.510
If you don't like it,
you don't have to pay.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.790
What I brought today
are all top-notch goods.

17:11.790 --> 17:12.440
Thank you.

17:12.440 --> 17:14.680
Put my hat down.

17:15.710 --> 17:16.400
Friend,

17:16.440 --> 17:17.440
are you buying pigeons?

17:17.440 --> 17:18.530
Come here, look.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.030
These pigeons of mine,

17:20.030 --> 17:21.640
when they fly into the sky,

17:21.640 --> 17:23.400
they can do 7 or 8 somersaults.

17:23.400 --> 17:24.680
And when they almost hit the ground,

17:24.680 --> 17:25.750
they fly back up.

17:25.839 --> 17:27.030
They also know the way.

17:27.030 --> 17:27.790
They know the way.

17:27.790 --> 17:29.230
No matter how far they fly,

17:29.230 --> 17:30.630
if you blow this whistle,

17:32.360 --> 17:34.320
they'll fly right back.

17:35.270 --> 17:37.440
Re-really?

17:37.440 --> 17:38.680
Of course it's true, friend.

17:38.680 --> 17:39.250
Friend,

17:39.470 --> 17:40.920
since your pigeons are so amazing,

17:40.920 --> 17:42.080
can they help me find someone

17:42.080 --> 17:43.320
in this bazaar?

17:43.920 --> 17:44.920
Friend,

17:44.920 --> 17:46.550
you can just buy it.

17:46.550 --> 17:47.840
These are not eagles.

17:47.840 --> 17:49.700
How can they find someone for you?

17:50.710 --> 17:52.180
Come take a look.

18:14.050 --> 18:15.210
Help!

18:21.770 --> 18:22.690
Help!

18:24.810 --> 18:26.050
Help!

18:30.840 --> 18:32.700
Xia Zi!

18:32.730 --> 18:33.770
Are you okay, Xia Zi?

18:33.770 --> 18:34.290
I'm fine.

18:34.290 --> 18:35.550
Are you hurt anywhere?

18:36.140 --> 18:36.820
What's wrong with you?

18:36.820 --> 18:38.340
If you don't watch your sheep,

18:38.340 --> 18:39.800
what if they hurt someone?

18:40.250 --> 18:41.050
Xia Zi.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.420
Fang Nan.

18:44.730 --> 18:45.530
Are you okay?

18:45.530 --> 18:46.080
I'm fine.

18:46.080 --> 18:47.380
Why is it you?

18:49.150 --> 18:50.320
I'm sorry.

18:52.410 --> 18:53.140
It's okay.

18:53.690 --> 18:54.340
It's okay.

18:58.690 --> 19:00.160
Have you ever imagined

19:00.160 --> 19:00.690
Have some.

19:00.690 --> 19:01.010
Sure.

19:01.010 --> 19:04.470
the scene of reuniting
with your first love after years apart?

19:04.660 --> 19:06.660
I've rehearsed it countless times.

19:07.340 --> 19:09.470
A chance encounter at a street corner,

19:09.600 --> 19:12.530
a class reunion
where everyone has their own agenda,

19:12.660 --> 19:14.180
or someone's wedding,

19:14.920 --> 19:15.790
or even

19:16.310 --> 19:17.760
someone's funeral.

19:18.750 --> 19:21.380
When I saw Fang Nan again at the bazaar,

19:22.350 --> 19:25.500
I thought this was the most reasonable.

19:27.510 --> 19:29.040
The bazaar is like a father,

19:29.450 --> 19:30.510
and also a mother.

19:31.580 --> 19:33.710
The bazaar is everything in the world.

19:34.970 --> 19:37.940
So, of course, anything
can happen in the bazaar.

19:43.210 --> 19:44.750
Oh, stop wiping.

19:44.750 --> 19:45.680
You can't wipe it off.

19:45.680 --> 19:47.050
You have to wash it.

19:47.680 --> 19:48.440
That...

19:48.880 --> 19:49.940
should be cow dung.

19:50.600 --> 19:52.180
It can be rubbed off with water.

19:52.180 --> 19:54.550
Do you want to go
wash it off in my sheepfold?

19:54.550 --> 19:55.750
You have a sheepfold?

19:56.030 --> 19:57.290
What are you doing now?

19:57.600 --> 19:58.790
I sell sheep.

19:58.990 --> 19:59.750
My sheepfold

19:59.750 --> 20:01.510
is right on the way back to the city.

20:01.510 --> 20:04.160
I remember you went to Urumqi for college.

20:04.510 --> 20:05.970
Why are you selling sheep?

20:07.450 --> 20:08.450
Don't bring it up.

20:09.330 --> 20:11.230
I feel big cities don't suit me at all.

20:11.230 --> 20:12.490
Our Kashgar is better.

20:12.640 --> 20:13.320
How about you?

20:13.320 --> 20:14.030
I heard

20:14.030 --> 20:16.120
you're doing pretty well in Shanghai.

20:16.120 --> 20:17.190
Not really.

20:17.190 --> 20:18.440
Just average.

20:18.470 --> 20:19.630
Our Arzugul

20:19.660 --> 20:20.830
is now an executive at a

20:20.830 --> 20:22.030
real estate company in Shanghai.

20:22.030 --> 20:23.690
Don't listen to her nonsense.

20:24.290 --> 20:25.900
You don't need to be modest.

20:25.930 --> 20:27.560
You were always number one growing up.

20:27.560 --> 20:30.220
I'm not surprised at all
that you're doing well.

20:32.660 --> 20:33.660
How is Ms. Li?

20:33.860 --> 20:34.790
She's fine.

20:34.790 --> 20:36.160
My mom is retired now.

20:36.220 --> 20:38.880
She travels around every day
and is rarely seen.

20:43.250 --> 20:44.490
Are...

20:46.420 --> 20:47.580
Are you married?

20:49.270 --> 20:50.320
Who would I marry?

20:50.320 --> 20:52.720
It's good enough
that I can support myself.

20:54.510 --> 20:56.710
How long has it been
since we last saw each other?

20:56.710 --> 20:57.490
7 years?

20:58.380 --> 20:59.190
No.

20:59.580 --> 21:02.580
It's been 7 years
since we graduated from high school.

21:02.660 --> 21:03.660
But for us,

21:04.100 --> 21:06.010
it will be 6 years in 2 months.

21:08.050 --> 21:09.180
The last time we saw each other

21:09.180 --> 21:10.860
was during the summer vacation
of our freshman year,

21:10.860 --> 21:12.540
at the class reunion.

21:13.950 --> 21:15.480
I remember you didn't come.

21:19.010 --> 21:19.730
Right.

21:21.430 --> 21:22.490
Let me add you on WeChat.

21:22.490 --> 21:24.010
I only have your QQ,

21:24.010 --> 21:25.010
and you're never online.

21:25.010 --> 21:27.490
Are you two putting on
a blind date show in front of me?

21:27.490 --> 21:28.450
Should I leave?

21:28.580 --> 21:29.140
No.

21:29.140 --> 21:30.210
We've been classmates for so many years.

21:30.210 --> 21:31.380
Just adding WeChat.

21:31.660 --> 21:32.490
Help!

21:32.660 --> 21:34.690
The lamb was born not breathing.

21:34.690 --> 21:35.900
Come, help!

21:36.250 --> 21:37.530
Can someone help?

21:37.950 --> 21:40.750
Can someone help?
The lamb was born not breathing.

21:42.970 --> 21:44.120
Here, give it to me.

21:44.240 --> 21:45.400
Let me see.

22:02.140 --> 22:05.050
Thank you.

22:05.080 --> 22:06.210
Thank you, Mr. Fang.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.440
Mr. Fang, thanks to you.

22:08.620 --> 22:10.050
The new-breed lambs you sent over

22:10.050 --> 22:11.250
from your breeding base last time

22:11.250 --> 22:12.970
are really good.

22:12.970 --> 22:14.140
You're welcome.

22:14.160 --> 22:14.760
Thank you.

22:15.010 --> 22:15.730
Mr. Fang?

22:15.990 --> 22:17.340
Aren't you a sheep seller?

22:17.340 --> 22:18.490
A sheep seller?

22:18.550 --> 22:19.480
No, no, no.

22:20.120 --> 22:23.180
Mr. Fang is the youngest
engineer in our station.

22:23.180 --> 22:24.750
He does scientific research,

22:24.750 --> 22:25.990
and works on big projects.

22:25.990 --> 22:27.190
He's amazing.

22:27.190 --> 22:28.130
No.

22:28.270 --> 22:29.840
I do sell sheep,

22:29.840 --> 22:31.470
but our breeding base

22:31.470 --> 22:32.510
isn't for money.

22:32.510 --> 22:34.440
It's for data collection samples.

22:35.540 --> 22:36.690
Can I hold it?

22:36.770 --> 22:37.680
Sure.

22:38.440 --> 22:39.030
Careful.

22:39.510 --> 22:40.550
Be careful.

22:40.550 --> 22:41.440
Like this.

22:41.440 --> 22:43.440
Support its bottom with your hands.

22:43.620 --> 22:44.140
Right.

22:45.380 --> 22:46.430
I'm not very good at this.

22:46.430 --> 22:47.890
It's okay. This works too.

22:50.770 --> 22:53.940
Look at its nose bridge.
It's as high as Minawar's.

22:56.230 --> 22:57.630
Its mother is calling it.

22:58.680 --> 22:59.810
We're leaving, sir.

23:00.880 --> 23:01.880
-Thank you.
-Bye.

23:03.380 --> 23:05.510
It wasn't easy. He saved it.

23:08.140 --> 23:09.440
We haven't seen each other for so long.

23:09.440 --> 23:10.190
It's rare to run into you,

23:10.190 --> 23:11.680
and I couldn't even treat you to a meal.

23:11.680 --> 23:13.480
It's fine. We ate before coming.

23:15.720 --> 23:16.880
Sir, let's go.

23:19.790 --> 23:20.360
How...

23:20.360 --> 23:22.270
How long are you staying this time?

23:22.270 --> 23:23.930
I'll leave in a couple of days.

23:25.710 --> 23:26.320
Well...

23:27.400 --> 23:28.230
Alright.

23:28.230 --> 23:29.030
I'm leaving.

23:29.270 --> 23:29.950
Bye.

23:42.070 --> 23:51.900
[Six years ago]

24:14.470 --> 24:15.340
Fang Nan.

24:16.600 --> 24:17.950
Is this almond necklace

24:18.340 --> 24:19.450
for me?

24:21.190 --> 24:22.300
It's for Xia Zi.

24:25.660 --> 24:27.920
She's going to college in Shanghai.

24:28.770 --> 24:30.510
She has seen so much of the world.

24:30.510 --> 24:31.910
Would she even like this?

24:46.900 --> 24:48.660
Did I remember it wrong?

24:49.250 --> 24:52.140
Fang Nan said the last time we met was

24:52.140 --> 24:54.100
at the class reunion that summer.

24:54.620 --> 24:56.380
But I remember he didn't come.

25:09.340 --> 25:10.620
Happy wedding.

25:10.620 --> 25:11.510
A gift for you.

25:15.400 --> 25:17.050
As soon as I saw this box,

25:17.210 --> 25:19.010
I felt like it had your name on it.

25:23.270 --> 25:24.210
Thank you.

25:24.530 --> 25:25.730
I wish you happiness.

25:30.380 --> 25:31.750
Did you use to like him?

25:32.360 --> 25:34.210
You were the one who liked him.

25:34.210 --> 25:36.540
There was absolutely nothing between us.

25:37.360 --> 25:39.160
My fiance is so rich.

25:39.440 --> 25:41.190
Who cares about Fang Nan?

25:45.600 --> 25:46.840
Come, let's take a picture together.

25:46.840 --> 25:48.080
Let's take it later.

25:50.550 --> 25:52.320
Cheese.

25:55.010 --> 25:56.920
Great.

26:00.890 --> 26:02.410
Minawar!

26:05.990 --> 26:08.030
You're going to Shanghai now.

26:08.030 --> 26:09.160
Are you ignoring us?

26:09.530 --> 26:10.120
I am not.

26:10.120 --> 26:12.050
I texted you, but you didn't reply.

26:12.150 --> 26:13.780
Tell me how you've been.

26:16.080 --> 26:16.830
I...

26:17.270 --> 26:19.870
am joining the regional
song and dance troupe.

26:23.690 --> 26:26.140
Weren't you going to
apply for the dance academy

26:26.140 --> 26:28.000
and coming to Shanghai to find me?

26:30.750 --> 26:32.600
Not everyone is as lucky as you are,

26:32.600 --> 26:33.680
Xia Zi.

26:37.920 --> 26:39.330
Hey, you're here.

26:47.500 --> 26:49.040
A book says that

26:49.660 --> 26:50.680
in this world,

26:51.130 --> 26:53.060
there are only two types of people.

26:53.390 --> 26:54.540
Those who leave,

26:55.270 --> 26:56.440
and those who stay.

26:58.270 --> 26:59.160
Back then,

26:59.710 --> 27:00.820
I left.

27:02.250 --> 27:03.690
My hometown and friends

27:04.120 --> 27:05.690
were all left behind.

27:07.080 --> 27:08.030
Now,

27:09.250 --> 27:10.580
I am a bit envious of

27:10.970 --> 27:12.580
the friends who stayed.

27:36.480 --> 27:37.480
Mom.

27:41.140 --> 27:42.080
Adili.

27:44.230 --> 27:46.160
I encountered a mudslide on the mountain.

27:46.160 --> 27:47.490
Sorry to make you worry.

27:47.530 --> 27:48.160
Mom.

27:50.660 --> 27:51.250
Mom.

27:52.450 --> 27:54.380
Count them. See if any are missing.

28:16.270 --> 28:16.950
Adili,

28:17.950 --> 28:19.010
what are you doing?

28:19.640 --> 28:20.900
What are you thinking?

28:21.210 --> 28:22.640
She's getting married.

28:23.290 --> 28:26.020
Why are you more persistent
than the wind in the Gobi?

28:26.020 --> 28:27.720
No matter how deep your feelings are,

28:27.720 --> 28:30.450
you can't move someone
who has made up their mind.

28:30.470 --> 28:31.590
None of your business.

28:31.590 --> 28:32.240
Go home.

28:50.080 --> 28:53.010
This is the handmade chocolate
you asked me to bring.

28:53.350 --> 28:54.110
Thank you.

28:54.550 --> 28:56.180
How much is it? I'll transfer it to you.

28:56.180 --> 28:57.580
No need. It's very cheap.

28:58.190 --> 28:59.680
I can't just take it.

28:59.940 --> 29:01.920
You always bring things for me.

29:02.640 --> 29:03.900
It's no trouble at all.

29:09.600 --> 29:10.530
How have you been

29:10.610 --> 29:11.850
lately?

29:14.510 --> 29:15.490
I've been good.

29:15.970 --> 29:16.640
Do you know

29:16.640 --> 29:18.190
who I ran into the other day?

29:20.100 --> 29:20.820
Fang Nan.

29:21.190 --> 29:22.160
Fang Nan?

29:22.730 --> 29:24.830
I ran into him with Arzugul.

29:26.120 --> 29:27.710
When I saw him that day,

29:28.010 --> 29:30.270
I felt like we were back in our childhood.

29:31.030 --> 29:32.550
I remember

29:32.880 --> 29:34.680
you and Arzugul had a falling out

29:35.400 --> 29:37.460
because of Fang Nan back then, right?

29:38.840 --> 29:41.190
Stop thinking that girls only fight

29:41.190 --> 29:42.640
over men, okay?

29:42.730 --> 29:44.290
Men aren't that important.

29:45.210 --> 29:46.190
But I see that you two have been

29:46.190 --> 29:47.880
at odds all these years.

29:48.620 --> 29:50.750
Back then, Fang Nan always

29:50.750 --> 29:52.680
hung out with us to pursue Arzugul.

29:52.820 --> 29:54.640
I thought he liked me.

29:55.270 --> 29:56.270
It's that simple.

29:56.560 --> 29:57.560
That simple?

30:00.440 --> 30:01.460
Later,

30:02.280 --> 30:04.190
Arzugul went to college

30:04.670 --> 30:05.910
in Shanghai,

30:06.710 --> 30:08.300
stayed there,

30:09.570 --> 30:11.650
and then bought a house there.

30:12.670 --> 30:13.650
And I

30:15.320 --> 30:16.870
have always been here,

30:17.620 --> 30:18.990
unable to go anywhere.

30:21.550 --> 30:23.350
I'm inferior to her in every way.

30:27.230 --> 30:29.300
You've never been inferior to Arzugul.

30:29.300 --> 30:30.690
I've always said so,

30:30.790 --> 30:32.520
but you just never believed it.

30:39.240 --> 30:40.600
Let me try this candy.

30:40.950 --> 30:42.030
If it's good,

30:42.990 --> 30:45.270
I'll buy a lot for the gifts

30:45.830 --> 30:46.860
at my wedding.

30:49.470 --> 30:50.580
You must

30:50.580 --> 30:51.980
come early to my wedding.

31:21.470 --> 31:23.690
New city,

31:24.160 --> 31:26.470
new beginning.

31:33.600 --> 31:34.640
Sir,

31:35.080 --> 31:36.600
can I help you?

31:36.880 --> 31:38.080
Who are you?

31:38.580 --> 31:39.770
Where's Wang?

31:41.880 --> 31:42.950
This is my shop.

31:43.470 --> 31:44.550
-He rented it to me.
-Your shop?

31:44.550 --> 31:46.370
Yes, and now I run this guesthouse.

31:46.370 --> 31:47.330
To you?

31:47.360 --> 31:48.990
I am the landlord.

31:49.010 --> 31:50.000
Leave.

31:50.030 --> 31:51.090
No, sir.

31:51.110 --> 31:52.310
You must be mistaken.

31:53.080 --> 31:55.410
He said he rented this
from you for 5 years.

31:55.440 --> 31:56.600
We just signed the contract.

31:56.600 --> 31:57.360
Contract?

31:57.790 --> 31:59.190
I won't look at it.
The lease has expired, no more renting.

31:59.190 --> 32:00.680
Sir, I've already paid.

32:00.680 --> 32:01.950
I gave him 100,000 a year.

32:01.950 --> 32:02.340
What?

32:02.340 --> 32:03.160
You can take a look.

32:03.160 --> 32:04.190
100,000?

32:04.550 --> 32:06.360
He only gave me 30,000!

32:06.360 --> 32:07.270
Leave.

32:07.270 --> 32:08.120
Go away.

32:08.120 --> 32:09.470
-Sir, I've paid the rent.
-Leave.

32:09.470 --> 32:10.030
Leave.

32:10.030 --> 32:11.560
I have the transfer record.

32:12.190 --> 32:13.360
Sir, is there a misunderstanding?

32:13.360 --> 32:13.710
Sir!

32:13.710 --> 32:14.440
Leave.

32:16.460 --> 32:17.160
Wait, sir.

32:18.060 --> 32:18.610
Leave

32:18.630 --> 32:19.220
Go away.

32:36.270 --> 32:37.920
Mom.

32:39.560 --> 32:40.250
Mom!

32:41.660 --> 32:42.270
Wake up.

32:45.100 --> 32:45.900
You scared me.

32:45.920 --> 32:47.640
How are you so strong?

32:48.890 --> 32:50.530
You pressed so hard. My chest hurts.

32:50.530 --> 32:51.380
What are you doing?

32:51.380 --> 32:52.190
You scared me.

32:52.190 --> 32:54.140
Right. Don't speak yet.

32:55.110 --> 32:56.400
I'm afraid I'd forget.

32:56.420 --> 32:57.940
Let me write it down.

33:00.710 --> 33:03.210
It has an analgesic effect.

33:04.100 --> 33:05.720
If you take too much, it will have

33:05.720 --> 33:08.130
a sedative and sleep-inducing effect.

33:11.050 --> 33:13.510
Are you playing
Shennong tasting the herbs?

33:14.610 --> 33:15.720
What else?

33:15.750 --> 33:16.790
Once your father died,

33:16.790 --> 33:18.650
your mother has to seek death too?

33:19.380 --> 33:20.180
Don't worry.

33:20.770 --> 33:22.530
I'm not that fragile.

33:25.440 --> 33:26.450
Why are you back?

33:27.850 --> 33:28.330
I...

33:29.960 --> 33:31.760
I'm going back to Shanghai soon.

33:32.380 --> 33:34.110
I came back to keep you company.

33:42.850 --> 33:45.050
Why are there so many flowers suddenly?

33:47.190 --> 33:48.210
Look.

33:48.620 --> 33:50.290
These Panax notoginseng,

33:50.520 --> 33:52.760
mint, honeysuckle,

33:53.530 --> 33:54.790
each one is a treasure.

33:57.530 --> 33:59.380
Birth, aging, sickness and death

33:59.380 --> 34:01.420
are like the rotation of the four seasons,

34:01.420 --> 34:02.580
all natural laws.

34:04.190 --> 34:06.450
We should let go of your father's matter.

34:14.320 --> 34:15.040
Mom.

34:16.690 --> 34:18.570
Regarding my father's death,

34:19.489 --> 34:21.949
I really can't accept
his sudden departure.

34:22.090 --> 34:23.500
I am not as detached as you,

34:23.500 --> 34:24.630
nor as open-minded.

34:25.469 --> 34:27.070
I can't let go so quickly.

34:27.739 --> 34:29.540
Seeing you tough it out like this

34:29.860 --> 34:31.260
makes me feel even worse.

34:50.320 --> 34:51.340
Your father,

34:52.630 --> 34:54.350
a man of over 80 kg,

34:55.310 --> 34:57.310
was brought back in such a light box.

35:00.360 --> 35:02.380
Do you think my heart doesn't hurt?

35:17.340 --> 35:18.040
Take this.

35:25.730 --> 35:27.960
I still have to
revise prescriptions tonight.

35:27.960 --> 35:29.800
You don't have to come all the way here.

35:29.800 --> 35:30.640
Go back.

35:32.920 --> 35:35.720
I've been used to being alone
for so many years.

35:35.860 --> 35:38.260
Just go back to Shanghai
with peace of mind.

35:38.450 --> 35:40.490
Life still has to go on.

35:44.490 --> 35:47.430
I still have a bunch of
little babies to take care of.

36:17.390 --> 36:18.470
Hello, Mr. Li.

36:18.500 --> 36:19.940
You're still up so late.

36:20.650 --> 36:22.780
Have you sorted out the things at home?

36:24.220 --> 36:25.150
Yes, I have.

36:25.970 --> 36:26.840
Rest assured.

36:27.360 --> 36:29.810
I'll definitely hurry up to make up for

36:29.920 --> 36:32.170
the unfinished work
from before these days.

36:32.170 --> 36:32.950
I have a client

36:32.950 --> 36:35.370
who really likes
the Yengisar knives from here.

36:35.370 --> 36:37.030
I bought one for him this time.

36:38.550 --> 36:39.630
There is something

36:39.630 --> 36:41.150
I need to inform you about.

36:43.260 --> 36:44.090
Go ahead.

36:44.400 --> 36:47.110
Recently, the company
has made structural adjustments,

36:47.110 --> 36:50.220
decided to reduce costs, increase
efficiency, and cut sales positions.

36:50.220 --> 36:52.420
It's not that I haven't warned you before.

36:52.420 --> 36:53.070
Your team

36:53.070 --> 36:54.670
has been at the bottom
in performance more than once.

36:54.670 --> 36:56.990
I've told you so many times,
but there's no improvement.

36:56.990 --> 36:58.520
Everyone competes fairly.

36:58.550 --> 37:00.800
Eliminating the worst performers
is company policy.

37:00.800 --> 37:04.060
Come back as soon as possible
and handle your resignation.

37:08.380 --> 37:10.180
Hello, the number you dialed...

37:10.200 --> 37:11.800
Wang, answer the phone.

37:15.960 --> 37:18.080
It's Zhou Hengzhi!

37:21.300 --> 37:22.260
You know me?

37:23.450 --> 37:24.700
Poor guy.

37:24.700 --> 37:27.560
You rented an empty house
from the old miser Mehmet,

37:27.570 --> 37:29.050
and were scammed out of 100,000 yuan

37:29.050 --> 37:30.470
by your best friend.

37:32.840 --> 37:33.970
H-how did you know?

37:33.970 --> 37:34.940
Of course we know.

37:34.940 --> 37:36.800
Our friend Abudu told us.

37:53.420 --> 37:54.760
Oh, please.

38:08.220 --> 38:09.940
Don't be angry.

38:09.940 --> 38:11.650
Anger feeds the devil.

38:11.650 --> 38:13.280
Don't worry.

38:13.280 --> 38:14.740
Worry makes you die early.

38:14.970 --> 38:16.570
Don't be anxious.

38:36.720 --> 38:37.450
Hi.

38:39.030 --> 38:40.160
What a coincidence.

38:40.410 --> 38:41.510
Are you here...

38:42.570 --> 38:43.420
for a walk?

38:44.900 --> 38:46.160
Want to walk together?

38:46.770 --> 38:47.660
I'm hungry.

38:53.820 --> 38:55.130
So,

38:55.780 --> 38:57.340
you paid all the money,

38:58.010 --> 38:59.650
and your friend ran away?

39:02.520 --> 39:03.770
Who said

39:04.070 --> 39:06.670
he wanted to be
the missing piece of the puzzle?

39:07.800 --> 39:09.630
I admit, I was slapped in the face.

39:09.630 --> 39:10.360
Okay?

39:12.440 --> 39:13.840
You're talking about me?

39:14.050 --> 39:15.850
You're not any better yourself.

39:15.880 --> 39:16.880
You lost your job.

39:17.630 --> 39:18.690
Are you going back?

39:18.700 --> 39:20.130
Of course I have to.

39:20.680 --> 39:22.290
If I don't go back, who will pay me?

39:22.290 --> 39:23.710
Who will pay my mortgage?

39:24.470 --> 39:25.260
I think

39:25.800 --> 39:27.340
we can celebrate.

39:28.200 --> 39:29.820
What to celebrate? Things are like this.

39:29.820 --> 39:30.470
No.

39:30.840 --> 39:31.840
Since things are this bad,

39:31.840 --> 39:33.640
they can't get any worse, right?

39:34.310 --> 39:36.910
What's that inspirational quote again?

39:38.840 --> 39:40.970
Once you pick up
all the stones at the bottom,

39:40.970 --> 39:43.300
the rest of your life
is an upward journey.

39:44.610 --> 39:46.630
You're quite good at it.

39:48.450 --> 39:49.260
You want some?

39:50.840 --> 39:51.570
Chopsticks.

39:54.970 --> 39:56.300
What are you looking at?

39:56.470 --> 39:57.180
Look.

39:59.360 --> 40:01.360
Who said things couldn't get worse?

40:03.340 --> 40:05.380
Rose Garden's construction suspended.

40:05.380 --> 40:07.180
Resumption date to be notified.

40:10.440 --> 40:11.900
Is it the house you bought?

40:13.720 --> 40:14.940
Even if things are worse,

40:14.940 --> 40:16.220
this noodle

40:16.570 --> 40:17.670
is not too bad.

40:21.670 --> 40:23.780
So this is how you cheer yourself up?

40:30.880 --> 40:34.650
Three, two, one, cheese!

40:51.090 --> 40:58.810
♪ An empty bowl is enough ♪

41:00.620 --> 41:08.800
♪ I'll take it as my wine cup ♪

41:09.730 --> 41:13.730
♪ My only confidants now ♪

41:14.760 --> 41:18.600
♪ Are these four lonely walls ♪

41:19.410 --> 41:22.660
♪ The sound of the dutar ♪

41:23.530 --> 41:26.150
♪ Has already drunk my heart ♪

41:28.140 --> 41:36.600
♪ I play my instrument with care ♪

41:37.900 --> 41:46.910
♪ So the neighbors won't be aware ♪

41:47.530 --> 41:56.640
♪ Take the world, I give it to you ♪

41:57.410 --> 42:06.910
♪ Just leave me my lonely,
sorrowful tune ♪

42:07.050 --> 42:11.150
♪ The dutar is my lover ♪

42:11.880 --> 42:16.150
♪ The dutar is my wine ♪

42:16.720 --> 42:20.500
♪ The dutar is where my hangovers begin ♪

42:21.640 --> 42:24.900
♪ Let everyone stay away ♪

42:26.510 --> 42:30.150
♪ Leave me here alone ♪

42:31.310 --> 42:34.850
♪ In grief, in sorrow, in the cold ♪

42:34.970 --> 42:38.380
Don't be angry.

42:36.480 --> 42:41.150
♪ My lover is my wine ♪

42:38.780 --> 42:42.490
Anger feeds the devil.

42:41.170 --> 42:44.640
♪ My lover is where my hangovers begin ♪

42:48.510 --> 42:49.900
Let me ask you something.

42:49.900 --> 42:50.700
The other day,

42:51.800 --> 42:53.990
I saw you at the grand bazaar.

42:54.670 --> 42:55.800
Who was that boy?

42:56.320 --> 42:57.840
He seemed to know you very well.
